Production-ready Api Response (response Vo) Design For Spring Boot Microservices

This design ensures a common, parameterized, and production-standard response structure that can be reused across all service layers. It includes:

Unified ResponseVo

ResponseBuilder utility

ErrorCode enum for centralized error management

Global exception handling

Clean, extensible, and developer-friendly API responses



